      % We measure the prefix only AFTER creating an actual TikZ node:
      % inside a bare tikzpicture the font is nullfont, so measuring
      % the prefix in a plain TeX hbox would incorrectly yield 0pt.
      % Without @ keep the previous inset for ordinary hierarchy edges.
      % With @ the attachment is exactly at the NEXT glyph's start.
